1
00:00:00,343 --> 00:00:02,723
(Sheldon:)Leonard, check it out.

2
00:00:02,888 --> 00:00:04,888
I bought an N gage locomotive.

3
00:00:05,057 --> 00:00:07,017
HaIf the size of HO.

4
00:00:07,184 --> 00:00:09,434
(Sheldon:)Look, it fits in my mouth.

5
00:00:11,229 --> 00:00:12,939
(Leonard:)Sounds like you had a great night.

6
00:00:13,106 --> 00:00:15,066
(Howard:)I did.

7
00:00:16,318 --> 00:00:17,608
(Sheldon:)- How was yours?
- Not bad.

8
00:00:17,819 --> 00:00:20,279
(Leonard:)I had a lot more fun with Amy
than I thought I would.

9
00:00:20,447 --> 00:00:23,537
- What do you mean by that?
- It turns out she really knows...

10
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:26,290
(Leonard:)...how to help a guy loosen up
and have a good time.

11
00:00:26,453 --> 00:00:30,163
AIthough, truth be told,
my groin's a little worse for wear.

12
00:00:31,249 --> 00:00:32,789
(Leonard:)Ow!

13
00:00:36,213 --> 00:00:38,173
- Why'd you do that?
- To send a message.

14
00:00:38,340 --> 00:00:40,590
(Sheldon:)She is not for you.

15
00:00:41,259 --> 00:00:43,179
- What?
- Not for you.

16
00:00:54,064 --> 00:00:55,854
(Bernadette:)Good morning, handsome.

17
00:00:56,858 --> 00:00:58,778
(Howard:)Morning, Mom.

18
00:01:01,571 --> 00:01:03,571
(Bernadette:)It's me.

19
00:01:05,534 --> 00:01:08,374
(Howard:)Yes, it is.
And you're so pretty in the morning.

20
00:01:10,372 --> 00:01:12,162
(Bernadette:)Your mom and I made you breakfast.

21
00:01:12,332 --> 00:01:15,752
Oh, wow, heh,
so you guys are getting along?

22
00:01:15,919 --> 00:01:17,549
(Bernadette:)Yeah, I guess.

23
00:01:17,712 --> 00:01:21,462
(Bernadette:)We're very different people, Howard,
so communication's a little tricky.

24
00:01:21,633 --> 00:01:23,843
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Does he like the pancakes?

25
00:01:24,010 --> 00:01:26,050
(Bernadette(in a similar voice):)He didn't try them yet!

26
00:01:29,391 --> 00:01:32,351
- ls there any butter? Heh.
- It's butter-flavored syrup.

27
00:01:32,519 --> 00:01:34,019
So? what's the word?

28
00:01:34,187 --> 00:01:36,147
(Bernadette:)He wants butter!

29
00:01:37,816 --> 00:01:39,856
It's butter-flavored syrup!

30
00:01:40,026 --> 00:01:42,696
(Bernadette:)I just told him that!

31
00:01:48,618 --> 00:01:49,868
(Howard:)I don't need any butter.

32
00:01:50,036 --> 00:01:53,076
(Bernadette:)If you want butter, I'll get you butter.

33
00:01:57,210 --> 00:02:00,210
Well, I guess I'll cut these by myseIf.

